      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "🔀 3 TIPOS DE PLATAFORMA\n(Cusumano cap. 1)\n\n🟠 TRANSACCIONAL\n   marketplace, intermediaria\n   📌 Uber, Tinder, ML, Airbnb\n\n🟠 INNOVACIÓN\n   ecosistema, base tecnológica\n   📌 iOS, Android, AWS, Steam\n\n🟠 HÍBRIDA\n   marketplace + ecosistema\n   📌 Apple, Amazon, Google,\n        Tencent\n\n⚠️ Riesgo: antitrust",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "node4-rect",
      "originalText": "🔀 3 TIPOS DE PLATAFORMA\n(Cusumano cap. 1)\n\n🟠 TRANSACCIONAL\n   marketplace, intermediaria\n   📌 Uber, Tinder, ML, Airbnb\n\n🟠 INNOVACIÓN\n   ecosistema, base tecnológica\n   📌 iOS, Android, AWS, Steam\n\n🟠 HÍBRIDA\n   marketplace + ecosistema\n   📌 Apple, Amazon, Google,\n        Tencent\n\n⚠️ Riesgo: antitrust",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 18
    },
